{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intuitive controls \u2013</strong> By keeping the same controls scheme for each stage, the player will be able to adapt quickly to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Never alone \u2013</strong> The swarm will follow the main character and represent the life available to the player. This swarm can also be controlled by other players allowing up to 8 players cooperative play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your path \u2013</strong> As your progress through the story, you can choose which upgrade you want to unlock to customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaos system \u2013</strong> As your progress through the story, you will be unlocking each stage completed and be able to play them in competitive multiplayer. In competitive multiplayer, you will be allowed to choose you own chaos value which will determine how much chaos will occurs during the match.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610130?t=1743018492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610130?t=1743018492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610130/a1b4d04895a82c69d3d20c485186eb928d92ecef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743018492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610130/a1b4d04895a82c69d3d20c485186eb928d92ecef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743018492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together"